#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:5
msgid "Cell"
msgstr "单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:8
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:10
msgid ""
"A cell from the `title block`_ is the most basic storage unit available. The"
" three different type of cells are: empty cell, text cell and logo cell."
msgstr "`图框 <title block_>`_ 中的单元格是最基本的存储单位。三种不同的单元格类型为：空单元格、文本单元格和徽标单元格。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:14
msgid "Empty cell"
msgstr "空单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:16
msgid ""
"An empty cell is used when the area occupied by the cell should be empty and"
" without any edge displayed. This type of cell has no properties."
msgstr "当单元格占用的区域应为空白且不显示任何边框时，使用空单元格。此类单元格没有属性。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block empty cell properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框空单元格属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:26
msgid "Text cell"
msgstr "文本单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:28
msgid ""
"An text cell is used when the area occupied by the cell should be filled by "
"string information inside a rectangle. This type of cell has different "
"parameters that can be defined."
msgstr "当单元格占用的区域需要用矩形内的字符串信息填充时，使用文本单元格。此类单元格有多个可定义的参数。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:34
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block text cell properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框文本单元格属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:38
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:69
msgid "Name from cell"
msgstr "单元格的名称"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst
msgid "Label"
msgstr "标签"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:42
msgid ""
"When the cell should display a variable from the folio or project "
"properties, the label is the text that appears before the variable."
msgstr "当单元格需要显示来自图幅或项目属性的变量时，标签就是出现在该变量之前的文本。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文本"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:46
msgid ""
"It can be a simple string defined by the user or a variable from the folio "
"or project (Ex: Author, Revision, Date, project name, folio page, etc.)."
msgstr "它可以是用户定义的简单字符串，也可以是来自图幅或项目的变量（例如：Author、Revision、Date、项目名称、图幅页码等）。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst
msgid "Font"
msgstr "字体"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:50
msgid "Font from the label and text of the cell."
msgstr "单元格标签和文本的字体。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "对齐"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:54
msgid ""
"Vertical and horizontal position of the label and text from the cell inside "
"the cell."
msgstr "单元格内标签和文本在垂直和水平方向上的位置。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:57
msgid "Logo cell"
msgstr "徽标单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:59
msgid ""
"A logo cell is used when the area occupied by the cell should be filled by a"
" picture inside a rectangle. This type of cell has different parameters that"
" can be defined."
msgstr "当单元格占用的区域需要用矩形内的图片填充时，使用徽标单元格。此类单元格有多个可定义的参数。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:65
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block logo cell properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框徽标单元格属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst
msgid "Logo"
msgstr "徽标"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:73
msgid "Name of the Scalable Vector Graphic (SVG) file with the logo image."
msgstr "包含徽标图像的可缩放矢量图形（SVG）文件名称。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/cell.rst:77
msgid ""
"Many different tools allows you to create Scalable Vector Graphics, SVG "
"files. Inside the Open Source world, `Inkscape`_ is on of the recommended "
"tools."
msgstr "许多不同的工具都可以用来创建可缩放矢量图形（SVG）文件。在开源世界里，`Inkscape <Inkscape_>`_ 是推荐的工具之一。"
